                  Groups
          %p
            for its
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/multiplicative+group"} multiplicative group
            of unit-
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/norm"} norm
            elements. Specifically this is the
            = succeed "," do
