            of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi p
                    %mrow
                      %mi S
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                      %msub
                        %mi 𝒱
                        %mi X
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} p_{S(\mathcal{V}_X)}
            in the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classical+model+structure+on+topological+spaces"} classical model structure on topological spaces
            is the inclusion of the unit
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sphere+bundle"} sphere bundle
            into the unit disk bundle
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi D
                    %mi X
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %msub
                    %mi 𝒱
                    %mi X
